| Options: 640x360, each of vcenc's settings in turn, each stream decoded
| again and compared: Main, Baseline, SPS/PPS before every keyframe with
| a keyframe every 10, constant 2 Mbit/s (and constant, and 2 Mbit/s, on
| their own; constant 3 Mbit/s at 720p), a keyframe asked for at picture
| 17, PCI memory, 4 input buffers, quantisers 20 to 30, level 4.0.
| Reports to ResultO.
| (a GCCSDK program: needs SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport loaded)
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error This needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error This needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
WimpSlot -min 40960K -max 40960K
Remove <Obey$Dir>.ResultO
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcenctest -d -t -s 640x360 -n 40 -p main -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultO
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcenctest -d -t -s 640x360 -n 40 -p baseline -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultO
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcenctest -d -t -s 640x360 -n 40 -i -g 10 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultO
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcenctest -d -t -s 640x360 -n 40 -c -b 2000000 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultO
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcenctest -d -t -s 640x360 -n 40 -c -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultO
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcenctest -d -t -s 640x360 -n 40 -b 2000000 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultO
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcenctest -d -t -s 1280x720 -n 100 -c -b 3000000 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultO
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcenctest -d -t -s 640x360 -n 40 -k 17 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultO
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcenctest -d -t -s 640x360 -n 40 -m pci -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultO
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcenctest -d -t -s 640x360 -n 40 -B 4 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultO
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcenctest -d -t -s 640x360 -n 40 -q 20,30 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultO
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcenctest -d -t -s 640x360 -n 40 -l 40 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultO
